+## Routes
+
+See the complete route list in `README.md`.
+
+- `POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty\n..." }`.
+  Each row sells a positive whole number of dish portions at an ISO instant.
+  Previously imported tickets are skipped; the entire file succeeds or fails
+  together. The response is `{ "tickets": 1, "dishes": 2 }`, counting new
+  tickets and portions.
+- `GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array
+  of `{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }`, where difference is
+  actual minus theoretical. Dates are inclusive UTC days; actual includes
+  all consume movements, and theoretical uses the saved sale ingredients.
+
